OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was killed by her ex-boyfriend
OL,7,FLogan MacPhail, who was 16 at the time
OL,8,Fand could not accept the relationship
OL,9,Fwas over. He had been controlling and
OL,10,Fstalked Holly in the run up to her
OL,11,Fdeath.
